WEBVTT

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:01.007
Her daughters 
will have to work quickly though—

00:02:01.007 --> 00:02:04.220
returning their mother 
to good health is urgent.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:05.780
In the surrounding area,

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:10.651
dozens of neighboring queens 
are building their own ant armies.

00:02:10.651 --> 00:02:14.101
These colonies 
have peacefully coexisted so far,

00:02:14.101 --> 00:02:16.205
but once workers appear,

00:02:16.205 --> 00:02:20.075
a phenomenon known as brood-raiding 
begins.

00:02:20.075 --> 00:02:23.269
Workers from nests 
up to several meters away

00:02:23.269 --> 00:02:26.055
begin to steal offspring 
from our queen.

00:02:26.055 --> 00:02:27.905
Our colony retaliates,

00:02:27.905 --> 00:02:31.235
but new waves of raiders 
from even further away